00:00:00,288 --> 00:00:01,768
Treatment Rankings.

2
00:00:01,768 --> 00:00:03,808
Currently, your doctor picks treatments based

3
00:00:03,808 --> 00:00:05,788
on: that drug rep who brought

4
00:00:05,788 --> 00:00:07,348
good donuts in two thousand and

5
00:00:07,348 --> 00:00:09,648
three, something they half-remember from medical

6
00:00:09,648 --> 00:00:12,628
school, whatever the insurance company allows,

7
00:00:12,628 --> 00:00:14,128
and vibes.

8
00:00:14,128 --> 00:00:17,028
This is called "evidence-based medicine,"

9
00:00:17,028 --> 00:00:18,908
which contains the word "evidence"

10
00:00:18,908 --> 00:00:20,348
the same way "grape soda"

11
00:00:20,348 --> 00:00:22,388
contains the word "grape.".

12
00:00:22,628 --> 00:00:24,468
Your decentralized F.D.A.

13
00:00:24,468 --> 00:00:26,828
will rank every treatment by what actually

14
00:00:26,828 --> 00:00:29,228
happened to real humans who took it:

15
00:00:29,228 --> 00:00:31,008
Outcome Labels.

16
00:00:31,008 --> 00:00:32,908
Food has nutrition labels.

17
00:00:32,908 --> 00:00:34,908
Cigarettes have warning labels.

18
00:00:34,908 --> 00:00:37,048
Drugs have forty-page inserts written

19
00:00:37,048 --> 00:00:38,948
by lawyers having seizures, which

20
00:00:38,948 --> 00:00:41,628
nobody reads, including your doctor.

21
00:00:41,668 --> 00:00:43,868
Your television advertisements show a smiling

22
00:00:43,868 --> 00:00:46,088
human frolicking through a meadow while

23
00:00:46,088 --> 00:00:47,688
a voiceover lists ways the drug

24
00:00:47,688 --> 00:00:50,188
might kill you at auctioneer speed.

25
00:00:50,188 --> 00:00:51,208
The meadow human does not

26
00:00:51,208 --> 00:00:53,338
react to the word "stroke."

27
00:00:53,688 --> 00:00:55,828
Side effects include "death," listed between

28
00:00:55,828 --> 00:00:57,988
"constipation" and "mild rash," as if

29
00:00:57,988 --> 00:00:59,508
your organs failing is roughly as

30
00:00:59,508 --> 00:01:01,608
inconvenient as dry skin.

31
00:01:01,668 --> 00:01:02,868
The label says "individual

32
00:01:02,868 --> 00:01:04,508
results may vary," meaning

33
00:01:04,508 --> 00:01:06,488
outcomes range from "cured"

34
00:01:06,488 --> 00:01:07,668
to "deceased"

35
00:01:07,668 --> 00:01:09,568
(both technically qualifying).

36
00:01:09,768 --> 00:01:11,608
It also says "ask your doctor,"

37
00:01:11,608 --> 00:01:12,868
but your doctor has seven minutes

38
00:01:12,868 --> 00:01:14,548
per appointment and just Googled your

39
00:01:14,548 --> 00:01:16,168
condition in the hallway.

40
00:01:16,368 --> 00:01:18,528
Your new system will produce Outcome Labels

41
00:01:18,528 --> 00:01:20,608
that tell you what actually happens when

42
00:01:20,608 --> 00:01:22,688
real humans take a drug.

43
00:01:22,688 --> 00:01:23,308
Not what a marketing

44
00:01:23,308 --> 00:01:25,248
department hopes happens.

45
00:01:25,248 --> 00:01:25,908
Not what a lawyer

46
00:01:25,908 --> 00:01:28,328
is comfortable admitting happens.

47
00:01:28,328 --> 00:01:28,601
What happens.
